## GET /attachments

**Service:** attachment
**Spec file:** applied-epic-attachment-v2.yaml
**Operation ID:** get-attachments
**Tags:** Attachments

### Summary
Get Attachments

### Description
Get list of attachments. This method requires version July 2023 of Epic or later to be utilized.

### Parameters

| Name | In | Required | Description |
|------|-----|----------|-------------|
| attachedOn_before | query | No | Finds attachments with an attached date before the specified date |
| attachedOn_after | query | No | Finds attachments with an attached date after the specified date |
| clientAccessible | query | No | Filters attachments based on whether they are client accessible or not |
| description | query | No | Finds attachments exactly matching the specified description |
| description_contains | query | No | Finds attachments containing the specified description |
| editedOn_before | query | No | Finds attachments with an edited date before the specified date |
| editedOn_after | query | No | Finds attachments with an edited date after the specified date |
| folder | query | No | Filters attachments by the specific folder  |
| inactiveOn_before | query | No | Finds attachments with an inactive date before the specified date |
| inactiveOn_after | query | No | Finds attachments with an inactive date after the specified date |
| systemGenerated | query | No | Finds attachments that are system generated (true) or created by users (false) |
| organization | query | No | Filters attachments that are associated to the specified organization |
| has_client_accessed | query | No | Filters attachments based on whether they have been accessed by clients or not |
| include_subfolders | query | No | Indicates whether to return any attachments directly within the specified folder (false) or to return any attachments within the specified folder and its nested sub-folders |
| accessible_by_employee_code | query | No | Filters attachments that are accessible to the provided employee code |
| accountType | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified account type |
|  |  | No | - |
| expand | query | No | Additional fields to be included in the response. |
|  |  | No | - |
|  |  | No | - |
| active_status | query | No | Filters attachments by active (true) or inactive (false) status |
| account | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified account |
| activity | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified activity |
| policy | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified policy |
| carrierSubmission | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified carrier submission |
| claim | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified claim |
| line | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified line |
| marketingSubmission | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified marketing submission |
| opportunity | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified opportunity |
| service | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified service |
| certificate | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified certificate |
| evidence | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified evidence |
| governmentReconciliation | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified government reconciliation |
| cancellation | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified cancellation |
| reconciliation | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified reconciliation |
| quote | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified quote |
| disbursement | query | No | Finds attachments associated to the specified disbursement |
|  |  | No | - |
| fileStatus | query | No | Finds attachments with matching fileStatus values |
| importantPolicyDocument | query | No | When true, returns only attachments flagged as important policy documents. When false, returns only attachments not flagged as important policy documents. When not provided, disregards important policy document status when retrieving attachments. |

### Responses

**200:** OK
