## GET /accounts/search

**Service:** account
**Spec file:** applied-epic-account-v1.yml
**Operation ID:** search-accounts
**Tags:** Accounts

### Summary
Search Accounts

### Description
Used to search across accounts. One of phone number or email search must be provided to recieve any results.

### Parameters

| Name | In | Required | Description |
|------|-----|----------|-------------|
|  |  | No | - |
|  |  | No | - |
| phoneNumber | query | No | Finds accounts where the phone number belongs to the account or contact |
| phoneNumber_contains | query | No | Finds accounts where that contain the phone number in the account or contact |
| type | query | No | Finds account by type. |
|  |  | No | - |
| email | query | No | Finds accounts where the email belongs to the account or contact |
| email_contains | query | No | Finds accounts where that contain the email in the account or contact |
| expand | query | No | Additional fields to be added to the response |

