content.text:
## GET /clients

**Service:** client
**Spec file:** applied-epic-client-v1.yml
**Operation ID:** get-clients
**Tags:** Clients

### Summary
Get Clients

### Description
Get list of clients. This method requires version July 2023 of Epic or later to be utilized.

### Parameters

| Name | In | Required | Description |
|------|-----|----------|-------------|
|  |  | No | - |
|  |  | No | - |
|  |  | No | - |
| embed | query | No | Specify a sub-resource to embed |
| active_status | query | No | Filters clients by active (true) or inactive (false) status |
| address_contains | query | No | Finds clients that contain the provided value in any part of its address or on a contact's address. |
| email | query | No | Finds clients that match the provided email address or have a contact with a matching email address. |
| email_contains | query | No | Finds clients that contain the provided value in any part of its email address or on a contact's email address. |
| enteredBy | query | No | Finds clients that were entered by a specific user |
| enteredBy_contains | query | No | Finds clients that were entered by a specific user containing the specified text |
| enteredOn_before | query | No | Finds clients that were entered before a specific date. |
| enteredOn_after | query | No | Finds clients that were entered after a specific date. |
| lookupCode | query | No | Finds clients by lookup code on the account |
| lookupCode_contains | query | No | Finds clients by lookup code on the account that contains text entered |
| name | query | No | Finds clients with matching full name |
| name_contains | query | No | Finds clients with matching text that contains full name |
| customId | query | No | Finds clients with matching Custom ID |
| customId_contains | query | No | Finds clients with Custom ID that contains the text |
| organization | query | No | Finds clients with a matching agency and or branch for an organization. |
